-----------------------------------------------
 Nested Loop
   Output: f1.id, (unnest('{1,2}'::integer[]))
   ->  Seq Scan on pg_temp.few f1
         Output: f1.id
   ->  ProjectSet
         Output: unnest('{1,2}'::integer[])
         ->  Result
               One-Time Filter: false
